# Module: Installation

**Purpose:** Decisions about how the system is adopted into a repository.

## Decision: art init Bootstrap

**Status:** Adopted

**Context:** New projects must adopt the system without manual setup, and existing files must never be clobbered. Adoption has to be safe to run in any repository, more than once.

**Decision:** `art init` / `npx art-init` inserts a marker-delimited bootstrap section into `AGENTS.md` (`<!-- ::ART-BOOTSTRAP:START/END -->`) and creates a `.agents/` skeleton — non-destructively and idempotently.
